 work, the release probably will take longer than wanted, as the 0.2 release.\r\n\r\n### Changelog:\r\n\r\nFixes:\r\n * RosterPage: Clear TextFields after closing AddContactSheet (#106) (@JBBgameich)\r\n\r\nUnused back-end features:\r\n * RosterController: Save lastMessage for each contact (#108) (@LNJ2)\r\n * Add database versioning and conversion (#110) (@LNJ2)\r\n * Database: Add new roster row `avatarHash` (#112) (@LNJ2)\r\n\r\nMisc:\r\n * CMake: Add feature summary (#109) (@LNJ2)"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KaidanIM/Kaidan/releases/6647445","assets_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/KaidanIM/Kaidan/releases/6647445/assets","upload_url":"https://uploads.github.com/repos/KaidanIM/Kaidan/releases/6647445/assets{?name,label}","html_url":"https://github.com/KaidanIM/Kaidan/releases/tag/v0.2.1","id":6647445,"author":{"login":"lnjX","id":13557034,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNTU3MDM0","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/13557034?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnjX","html_url":"https://github.com/lnjX","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnjX/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnjX/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnjX/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnjX/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnjX/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnjX/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnjX/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnjX/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lnjX/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"node_id":"MDc6UmVsZWFzZTY2NDc0NDU=","tag_name":"v0.2.1","target_commitish":"stable","name":"Version 0.2.1 - Roster Page style fix","draft":false,"immutable":false,"prerelease":false,"created_at":"2017-06-08T12:00:18Z","updated_at":"2017-06-08T12:06:40Z","published_at":"2017-